{
  "id": "list-matches",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Kalıpla bul",
    "en": "Find with a pattern"
  },
  "difficulty": 1,
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.py",
  "solution": "solution.py",
  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Windows'ta yollar `\\` ile gelir: `path.replace(\"\\\\\", \"/\")`.",
      "en": "On Windows paths come with `\\`: `path.replace(\"\\\\\", \"/\")`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`sorted(path.replace(\"\\\\\", \"/\") for path in glob.glob(pattern, recursive=True))`.",
      "en": "`sorted(path.replace(\"\\\\\", \"/\") for path in glob.glob(pattern, recursive=True))`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport glob\n\n\ndef list_matches(pattern):\n    found = glob.glob(pattern, recursive=True)\n    return sorted(path.replace(\"\\\\\", \"/\") for path in found)\n\nprint(len(list_matches(\"logs/2026-*.txt\")))\nfor path in list_matches(\"logs/**/*.txt\"):\n    print(path)\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport glob\n\n\ndef list_matches(pattern):\n    found = glob.glob(pattern, recursive=True)\n    return sorted(path.replace(\"\\\\\", \"/\") for path in found)\n\nprint(len(list_matches(\"logs/2026-*.txt\")))\nfor path in list_matches(\"logs/**/*.txt\"):\n    print(path)\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "name": "list_matches",
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": [
            "logs/2026-*.txt"
          ],
          "returns": [
            "logs/2026-01.txt",
            "logs/2026-02.txt"
          ]
        },
        {
          "args": [
            "logs/**/*.txt"
          ],
          "returns": [
            "logs/2025-11.txt",
            "logs/2025-12.txt",
            "logs/2026-01.txt",
            "logs/2026-02.txt",
            "logs/README.txt",
            "logs/old/2024-12.txt"
          ]
        },
        {
          "args": [
            "logs/202?-12.txt"
          ],
          "returns": [
            "logs/2025-12.txt"
          ]
        },
        {
          "args": [
            "logs/*.csv"
          ],
          "returns": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stdout",
      "match": "trimmed_lines",
      "expected": "2\nlogs/2025-11.txt\nlogs/2025-12.txt\nlogs/2026-01.txt\nlogs/2026-02.txt\nlogs/README.txt\nlogs/old/2024-12.txt"
    }
  ]
